00:58:13.690 --> 00:58:24.490
<v Nancy Updike>Our website, ThisAmericanLife.org, where you can stream our archive of over 750 episodes for absolutely free, again, ThisAmericanLife.org.
<v Nancy Updike>《美国生活》通过公共广播交流中心（PRX）分发给公共广播电台。谢谢，祝我们的老板艾拉·格拉斯生日快乐。我曾见过他因为声音被认出来，有时人们在公众场合认出他并问问题时，他确实心情复杂。

00:58:24.490 --> 00:58:43.600
<v Nancy Updike>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, and happy birthday, Ira, to our boss, Ira Glass. I once saw him get recognized for his voice, and he does have mixed feelings sometimes about the questions people ask when they recognize him in public.
<v Nancy Updike>当有人在杂货店走过来问我关于阴道分泌物的问题时，这可不怎么美妙。

00:58:43.600 --> 00:58:50.530
<v Amelia Huntsberger>When somebody comes up to me in the grocery store and wants to ask a question about vaginal discharge, that's not awesome.
<v Amelia Huntsberger>我是南希·厄普代克。欢迎下周继续收听《美国生活》的更多故事。

00:58:50.530 --> 00:58:55.530
<v Nancy Updike>I'm Nancy Updike. Join us next week for more stories of This American Life.
<v Nancy Updike>我是南希·厄普代克。欢迎下周收听更多《美国生活》的故事。
